160/161 caught. The one MISSED ("zap minimum removed") is an equivalent mutant: with amountIn 0 or 1 the zap swaps
nothing and adds zero liquidity, which already reverts ZeroAmount inside the unlock. The redundant check was removed
from EarnVault.zapDeposit and the mutation from the set, so the final code has 160 mutations, 160 caught.

